Description: Metronomo - keep time while practicing music
 Practice rhythm with a steady pulse, adjustable tempo and volume,
 configurable time signatures, and a different sound for each beat.
 Tap the tempo and save your favorite configurations as named presets.
 .
 Runs in a graphical X11 or Wayland session with a Vulkan-capable driver.
